WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:28.080
one of my top priorities over the next 24 to 96&nbsp;
hours is the safety of everybody in our audience,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:33.360
of people all over the United States is there is&nbsp;
a lot of unrest expected in the U.S. and in fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:39.360
police departments across the country as well as&nbsp;
D.C. police are expecting protests and unrest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.840
We've seen police departments scale up the&nbsp;
availability of crowd suppression tools. We've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:50.480
seen businesses board up windows in many parts of&nbsp;
the country. I've talked already about some of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:56.240
advice from universities, from travel departments&nbsp;
under the departments of State. In other countries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.760
like New Zealand and Australia, etc. But it is&nbsp;
also Donald Trump who will be barricading himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:07.600
behind a massive new non scalable fence today&nbsp;
at the White House. CNN and NBC News are now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:13.760
reporting that a supposedly non scalable fence&nbsp;
will be placed around the White House in time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.800
for the start of election results tonight.
These will be similar barriers to those that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.320
went up around the White House in June during the&nbsp;
police brutality protests. ICE officers are being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:29.760
put on standby. Customs and Border Protection&nbsp;
is issuing extra training on crowd control.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:36.080
National Guard troops are on standby. And remember&nbsp;
that originally Donald Trump was planning this big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.400
election night party at his Washington, D.C.&nbsp;
hotel. Why not make some money by hiring his own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:47.520
business to host the party? We learned yesterday&nbsp;
and talked about it on yesterday's bonus show that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:51.440
that party has been canceled. And instead,&nbsp;
Donald Trump is going to be hunkering down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:58.080
at the White House where he will reportedly hold&nbsp;
and indoor election night party. But, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:02.800
the suspicion really is twofold.
On the one hand, the big party at the hotel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:08.640
maybe has been canceled because the Trump campaign&nbsp;
is no longer expecting a win or at least maybe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:14.240
no longer expects a credible, definitive win&nbsp;
tonight as more votes will remain to be counted.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:20.800
But number two, in addition to that, the security&nbsp;
concerns make it preferable to keep Donald Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:26.800
at the White House behind a series of&nbsp;
concentric fences. And the suspicion, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:33.680
is that Donald Trump, from his White House bunker&nbsp;
behind a new fence, will claim victory tonight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:39.760
even if there is no actual victory visible in&nbsp;
the data that we have. By midnight tonight and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.000
then in will come Donald Trump's lawyers&nbsp;
and they will try to stop the counting of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.080
absentee ballots not yet received by midnight&nbsp;
tonight. You don't have to take my word for it.&nbsp;

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.960
Here is Donald Trump himself saying this is&nbsp;
what he plans to do because it can only lead to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:59.680
one thing, and that's very bad. You know what&nbsp;
that thing is? I think it's a very dangerous,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:05.200
terrible thing. And I think it's terrible when&nbsp;
we can't know the results of an election the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:11.200
night of the election and a modern day computer. I&nbsp;
think it's a terrible thing. And I happen to think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:16.800
it was a terrible decision for our country made&nbsp;
by the Supreme Court. I think it was a terrible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.920
decision for our country. And I think it's a very&nbsp;
dangerous decision because you're going to have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:28.800
one or two or three states, depending on how it&nbsp;
ends up with a tabulating ballot. And the rest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:34.560
of the world is waiting to find out. And I think&nbsp;
there's great danger to do it. And I think a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:41.040
of fraud and misuse could take place. I think&nbsp;
it's a terrible decision by the Supreme Court,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:46.000
a terrible decision. I don't know if that's&nbsp;
going to be change because we're going to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:51.600
in that night as soon as that election's&nbsp;
over. We're going in with our lawyers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:57.600
but we don't want to have Pennsylvania, where you&nbsp;
have a political governor, a very partizan guy.&nbsp;

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:03.200
So there it is. I mean, no no need to wonder&nbsp;
about what the plan is. We just need to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:10.240
ready. And I hope Biden's lawyers are ready now at&nbsp;
this point. I wouldn't even be shocked if Donald&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:15.040
Trump declares victory before all the votes&nbsp;
are counted. I wouldn't be shocked if Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:20.080
undermines the credibility of the results or says&nbsp;
Joe Biden couldn't possibly have won, if that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:28.160
indeed what happens. But we are looking now in&nbsp;
all seriousness, at major nationwide protests.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:32.960
If Donald Trump tries funny business&nbsp;
and if courts start going along with it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:38.720
we are going to see mass gatherings, the likes of&nbsp;
which this country has not seen for a long time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:44.080
That doesn't mean Trump will fail to&nbsp;
use the courts to steal the election.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:51.280
That's still a concern, which we have to hope&nbsp;
Joe Biden and the Democratic Party are ready for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:57.840
and prepared to fight back against. If we have&nbsp;
a simple election. And Donald Trump just loses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.800
it will be a very different type of&nbsp;
chaos. And we may see armed right wingers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:08.320
may be operating under the umbrella of being&nbsp;
a so-called militia. And that's very scary.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:14.400
But the optics of Trump putting up a fence and&nbsp;
barricading himself at the White House is both.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:21.520
Metaphorical for what many of us believe he will&nbsp;
try to do if he loses tonight, hold on to power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:27.280
But it is also very similar to the behavior we've&nbsp;
seen from authoritarian dictators around the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:33.440
close to the end of their reigns. Trump has said,&nbsp;
I may leave the country if I lose. Trump said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:38.240
too. I think it was Michigan last night. I will&nbsp;
never come back to Michigan if I lose. Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.880
is going to stay at the White House and put&nbsp;
new fencing around him. Trump is going to try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:50.400
to use the courts to retain power. These are the&nbsp;
actions of authoritarian dictators, the world over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:58.480
over the last hundred plus years. Let's just hope&nbsp;
that this is the beginning of the end rather than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:04.640
the halfway point in Donald Trump's reign. That&nbsp;
would be exhausting. That would be exhausting.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:10.320
If that were to be the case, if we're only halfway&nbsp;
